# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLEAN-ROOM: never commit any of the following.
#
# The denylist holds the very identifiers this repository is required not to
# carry (see LICENSE and the clean-room rule). Committing it would defeat the
# entire control. It is owner-supplied, machine-local, and permanently ignored.
scripts/denylist.local.txt
scripts/denylist.*.local.txt

# Local fixture directories that could hold real customer data. Fixtures that
# ship with this product live in src/fixtures/ and are fictional by rule.
/fixtures.local/
/local-data/
*.customer.json
*.customer.csv
